      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report that severely ill dogs and cats receive dedicated treatment, including oxygen support, heart scans, and gentle end-of-life care. Families highlight thoughtful details such as pawprints and keepsake fur clippings provided when pets sadly could not be saved."
      }
    },
    {
