        "en": "Lifesaving interventions for urgent cases"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers credit the hospital team with stabilizing pets suffering from acute heart failure, diabetic complications, and accidental poisoning. Pet parents express profound gratitude for prompt diagnostic ultrasound scans and rapid medical interventions that saved their pets."
      }
    }
